☁️ Networking Basics
What is a Subnet?
👉 A range of IP addresses inside VPC.
Public vs Private Subnet?
Public → Has internet access
Private → No direct internet
What is Security Group?
👉 Virtual firewall at instance level.
Security Group vs NACL?
SG → Stateful
NACL → Stateless
What is Internet Gateway?
👉 Allows VPC to connect to internet.
